   "source_title": "DLSS 4 Technology",
   "source_url": "https://www.nvidia.com/en-us/geforce/technologies/dlss/",
   "publisher": "Nvidia",
   "published_at": null,
   "findings": "A major strength is the use of dedicated NVIDIA hardware such as Tensor Cores. NVIDIA notes that DLSS was designed to benefit situations with high GPU load. The associated limitation is hardware and game dependence: DLSS features require supported NVIDIA hardware and a supported game implementation.",
   "limitations": "A major limitation in existing research is inconsistent benchmarking methodology. The group's proposal identifies variation in games, GPUs, resolutions, quality presets, and benchmark methods as a core problem.",
