   "source_title": "Intel XeSS",
   "source_url": "https://www.intel.com/content/www/us/en/developer/articles/technical/xess-sr-developer-guide.html?",
   "publisher": "Intel",
   "published_at": null,
   "findings": "XeSS also demonstrates why hardware architecture must be considered. Different hardware execution paths can affect performance and quality, which supports the group's decision to include GPU architecture as a moderating factor in the conceptual framework.",
   "limitations": "A third limitation is hardware dependence. A technology can behave differently depending on GPU architecture and execution path, making simplistic brand-based recommendations potentially misleading.",
